{"version":1,"content":"<p>西班牙兩列高速列車上周三（10月28日）發生追撞，造成至少69人死亡、數十人受傷，是該國一年內第二宗嚴重鐵路事故。</p><p>運輸大臣普恩特（Óscar Puente）周二（3日）在國會證實已離任，為今次慘劇承擔政治責任。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:45:47.680829+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:02:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:23.333814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:30.036905+00:00","content_hash":"58397a3023949c7f8c05b33e9211fedbb27f6bd28f33078465860d553c8d5761","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}